<h4 id="model-fitting">Model Fitting</h4>
<p>The <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">$model</code> method provides MCMC sampling. After sampling, one may obtain draws by calling <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">$draws()</code> from the fitted object.</p>

<figure class="highlight"><pre><code class="language-r" data-lang="r"><span class="c1"># minimal.rmd, continued</span><span class="w">
